      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i just got back from a super long flight from singapore to london yesterday and i feel kinda weird. im really out of breath just walking to the kitchen and my left calf is kinda sharp/sore if i move it. u think its just jet lag or travel fatigue?? im exhausted",
