    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait r u serious?? that sounds scarier than i thought. i dont really want to go to the er if i can avoid it, it's so expensive and always takes forever. is there any way i can just tell if it's actually something bad or if i can just sleep it off? like can i take some ibuprofen and see if the calf pain goes away by morning?",
